{"id":"n64682-1-9","stage":0,"title":"마시다 · 喝","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64682-1-9-1","ko":"국수 한 그릇 더 줄까?","zh":"要再给你一碗面吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"국수","meaning":"面，面条","explanation":"국수：面，面条。","readings":[{"term":"국수","audio":"/audio/93cbc370cae0859bb1b0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38579","senseId":"1","lemma":"국수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"국수","audio":"/audio/93cbc370cae0859bb1b0.mp3"}},{"text":"한","meaning":"一","explanation":"한：一。","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"1","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}},{"text":"그릇","meaning":"碗（量词）","explanation":"그릇：碗，也用作食物份数的量词；한 그릇 是“一碗”。","readings":[{"term":"그릇","audio":"/audio/7e60f5c15633cdc1f60c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31674","senseId":"3","lemma":"그릇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그릇","audio":"/audio/7e60f5c15633cdc1f60c.mp3"}},{"text":"더","meaning":"再，多","explanation":"더：再，多。","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"1","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}},{"text":"줄까?","meaning":"要再给你吗","explanation":"주다：给；-ㄹ까? 是提出建议或询问对方意愿的非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"줄까","audio":"/audio/36efbc1e892d961acce7.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"93cbc370cae0859b","term":"국수","zh":"面，面条","audio":"/audio/93cbc370cae0859bb1b0.mp3","entryId":"38579","definition":"将大麦、荞麦、土豆等的面粉和好，用刀子、机器或手做成的细长的食品；或指将其煮熟而做成的食物。","pronunciation":["국쑤"]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"一","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"一个的。","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"7e60f5c15633cdc1","term":"그릇","zh":"碗","audio":"/audio/7e60f5c15633cdc1f60c.mp3","entryId":"31674","definition":"数盛在餐具里的食物的数量单位。","pronunciation":["그륻"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"再，多","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"添补而继续。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"给予，给","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"把东西等递给别人，让别人拥有或使用。","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1f54ca79fde3d06500fc.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64682-1-9-2","ko":"아니요, 국수 국물까지 다 마셨더니 배가 불러요.","zh":"不用了，连面汤都喝光了，现在很饱。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니요,","meaning":"不用了","explanation":"아니요：礼貌地否定对方的提议，这里是“不用了”。","readings":[{"term":"아니요","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17189","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니요","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3"}},{"text":"국수","meaning":"面，面条","explanation":"국수：面，面条。","readings":[{"term":"국수","audio":"/audio/93cbc370cae0859bb1b0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38579","senseId":"1","lemma":"국수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"국수","audio":"/audio/93cbc370cae0859bb1b0.mp3"}},{"text":"국물까지","meaning":"连面汤也","explanation":"국물：汤；-까지 表示“连……也”，强调面汤也喝了。","readings":[{"term":"국물","audio":"/audio/28fc4f685e87f9f4926f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64512","senseId":"1","lemma":"국물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"국물까지","audio":"/audio/fc844f3aedc3d404e7e0.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都。","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"마셨더니","meaning":"喝了以后","explanation":"마시다：喝；-었더니 连接先前的行为和眼下的结果，这里是喝完后觉得饱。","readings":[{"term":"마시다","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64682","senseId":"1","lemma":"마시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마셨더니","audio":"/audio/7e59f3a7f99905029cb1.mp3"}},{"text":"배가","meaning":"肚子","explanation":"배：肚子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"배","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20211","senseId":"1","lemma":"배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"배가","audio":"/audio/c5a9b1ff55fc80e6120e.mp3"}},{"text":"불러요.","meaning":"饱了","explanation":"부르다：吃喝之后觉得饱；-어요 是礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"부르다","audio":"/audio/169eb5d7a0d76e97fa7f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26311","senseId":"1","lemma":"부르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"불러요","audio":"/audio/66d3e2451fce15ddc8a3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9474acc7539b7e2c","term":"아니요","zh":"不是，不用","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3","entryId":"17189","definition":"用于否定回答长辈所提出的问题。","pronunciation":["아니요"]},{"id":"93cbc370cae0859b","term":"국수","zh":"面，面条","audio":"/audio/93cbc370cae0859bb1b0.mp3","entryId":"38579","definition":"将大麦、荞麦、土豆等的面粉和好，用刀子、机器或手做成的细长的食品；或指将其煮熟而做成的食物。","pronunciation":["국쑤"]},{"id":"28fc4f685e87f9f4","term":"국물","zh":"汤水，汤汁","audio":"/audio/28fc4f685e87f9f4926f.mp3","entryId":"64512","definition":"在清汤或浓汤等食物里，除去汤料以外剩下的水。","pronunciation":["궁물"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"dbfc687cbb29318d","term":"마시다","zh":"喝，饮","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3","entryId":"64682","definition":"使水等液体流入喉咙。","pronunciation":["마시다"]},{"id":"3d0af87e12fd988a","term":"배","zh":"肚子","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3","entryId":"20211","definition":"人或动物的身体中胸部以下、腿部以上的部分。","pronunciation":["배"]},{"id":"169eb5d7a0d76e97","term":"부르다","zh":